{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/780eadb716e7db9963d69e40b2c3ddae.avif?t=1769053821\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Whimsy Bake\uff06Craft</i> is a laid-back idle simulation game. In your workshop, combine mysterious aquatic ingredients and enchanted crops to craft hundreds of delicious dishes. Whether it\u2019s farming, fishing, or baking\u2014no complex controls are needed. Just assign the right tools, ingredients, and staff, then let time do the rest. Watch as your automated production lines spring to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/36618eb6fc31a2698177def0626a502b.poster.avif?t=1769053821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/36618eb6fc31a2698177def0626a502b.webm?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/36618eb6fc31a2698177def0626a502b.mp4?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/f864833930fd834acabd985833131b95.avif?t=1769053821\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing here works by ordinary rules. Grab a pot, add some soil, count to five\u2026 and somehow you\u2019ve grown a sunglasses-wearing cat from a magic cube!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/3fac5c9fe411724d0f15010d832f7a44.poster.avif?t=1769053821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/3fac5c9fe411724d0f15010d832f7a44.webm?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/3fac5c9fe411724d0f15010d832f7a44.mp4?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/0ea3248ed8aeca5801401953ec8f23f1.avif?t=1769053821\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you cast your line, remember to bait your hook with a worm, some grass, or maybe even a depth charge! From ordinary Bread Fish to dangerous Nuke Fish\u2014all kinds of curious creatures are waiting beneath the surface, watching you \ud83d\udc40</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/95448d1d1119519de6250a62603e129f.poster.avif?t=1769053821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/95448d1d1119519de6250a62603e129f.webm?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/95448d1d1119519de6250a62603e129f.mp4?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/a01123f7de30e62f12251f4ec8de88a3.avif?t=1769053821\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town\u2019s Barter Market fluctuates daily. Sell the day\u2019s hottest items at the perfect moment to maximize profits! Use your earnings to unlock more workstations, buy better ingredients, and make even more money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/8fbbd9dd9a09b989bb748b1f8f585578.poster.avif?t=1769053821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/8fbbd9dd9a09b989bb748b1f8f585578.webm?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/8fbbd9dd9a09b989bb748b1f8f585578.mp4?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/fdd82c5460cd753bf04c690bc9a4ea2e.avif?t=1769053821\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to decorate your cabin! Buy all sorts of uniquely styled furniture from the shop to create your ideal layout while boosting your &quot;Beauty Rating.&quot; Save different design sets and switch between them instantly to match your mood. This is your home in the magical town\u2014where the in-game day/night cycle syncs with real time, immersing you in the charming rhythm of island life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/6846427e8377d23b6956b11c72be6001.poster.avif?t=1769053821\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/6846427e8377d23b6956b11c72be6001.webm?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713000/extras/6846427e8377d23b6956b11c72be6001.mp4?t=1769053821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Legend Begins!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3713000/468cb01fa0eeeadbbdea3a1def8d36e33fbb9fb7.jpg"},{"name":"The Basics of Magical Cultivation!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3713000/9b9f4565d2824c2a8e74b821fa9b2aef4034c36d.jpg"},{"name":"Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Water!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3713000/6f35b3102df6eaf69ee40fbb171f10644375f726.jpg"},{"name":"A Grand Journey in Baking Begins.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3713000/b9fff16db3132fa7abcb7c236015185a23350b38.jpg"},{"name":"Request, Complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3713000/95914ab8249aaf2f93778310d457159250758e8a.jpg"},{"name":"A Fresh Start to Cozy Home Life~","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3713000/082454fcf998f911d1bb3065de1edd796cd5f37b.jpg"},{"name":"Intro to Ice Magic~","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3713000/e08daba0a37720d8c907b5686a82f3dc7bde10c8.jpg"},{"name":"This Is What ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3713000/431ef2e528734067d3e4acb4383b0941939ec481.jpg"},{"name":"20,000 LP!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3713000/7b148d439fea829144902ecc4b1c7c7cef75f0fc.jpg"},{"name":"Stairway to Heaven!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco